& [RawInputs]
  + FormationValidationRecord raw bytes identity and parsed canonical B0 value remain separate
  + PreparationSimulationReceipt raw bytes identity and parsed canonical Revision 0.4 value remain separate
  + CommissionEnvelope CapabilityAccount MutationFencePlan OperatorAuthorizationArtifact UnresolvedAccount and AdmissionRequest are strict independent supplied objects
  + no parser derives operator consent current clock lease ledger capacity or physical state from supplied text

& [CommissionFields]
  + canonical UUIDs identify commission correlation and single attempt while issuer subject recovery owner and stage remain nonempty closed identities
  + carrier implementation bookend expected-current and provider-plan digest bind immutable upstream lineage
  + principal common directory worktree parent ledger root scratch role descendants and branch ref bind one closed future effect scope
  + maximum_attempts one retry_count zero authorization artifact identity and self-excluding commission digest are exact

& [CapabilityFields]
  + requested_future_grants is one ordered seven-item subset of the B0 twenty-two-item declaration
  + explicit_denials is the ordered complementary fifteen-item subset
  + grant_count denial_count unique_count overlap_count aggregate digest and issued_capability_count zero are independently checked

& [FenceFields]
  + steps is an ordered fixed-length ten-item list
  + declared_step_count is ten and maximum_step_count is ten and both equal actual list length
  + lease kind name acquisition wait zero continuous-hold start and end coordinates are explicit
  + claim path consumed path CreateNew mode claim-before-effect consumption-after-publication and release-after-consumption are explicit
  + second-observation account binds all current identity topology executable capacity process and zero-network coordinates
  + no-retry no-delete no-replace no-cleanup and retained-uncertainty booleans are mandatory

& [ReceiptFields]
  + receipt binds all component digests raw identities exact count accounts status authority and self-digest
  + issued authenticated consent freshness clock lease ledger consumed capacity execution implementation run contact mutation retained-state fields remain false
  + all consequence counters remain zero and unresolved production-broker conditions remain explicit

& [Bounds]
  + depth 32 fields 256 artifacts 16 artifact bytes 16777216 total 67108864 machine bytes 2097152 fence steps 10 capabilities 22
  + paths are portable artifact paths or exact canonical Windows scope paths according to field role and aliases are refused
  + SHA256 values are uppercase and Git identities lower forty-hex

& [Determinism]
  + domain-separated self-excluding digests cover each derived object
  + one evidence directory has exact artifact order and identity and verifies twice to byte-identical canonical receipt plus newline

& [EffectAccount]
  + design is supplied-data correspondence only
  + process filesystem write environment registry clock Git network provider model MCP cleanup unsafe D-drive WSL compaction and foreign effects are absent
